[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0885","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0885.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1030","title":"Behold Software Web Page Counter 2.70 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Behold Software Web Page Counter 2.70 版本的 counter.exe 存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过发送以 %0A（换行符）结尾的恶意 HTTP 请求，导致计数器日志记录畸形条目并触发访问冲突，使计数器程序挂起从而造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Behold Software Web Page Counter 2.70 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，属于中危级别拒绝服务漏洞，攻击者无需认证即可远程发起攻击，只需发送特制 HTTP 请求即可触发漏洞导致服务不可用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1030"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-05-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:33Z","remediation":"升级 Behold Software Web Page Counter 至修复该问题的后续版本（避免使用 2.70 的 counter.exe）。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（如 IIS）中配置 URL 重写或请求过滤规则，拦截包含 %0A（换行符）的 HTTP 请求，并在前端防火墙/反向代理处丢弃此类畸形请求，防止恶意换行写入计数器日志导致 counter.exe 访问违规而挂起。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92713790426690&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=92707671717292&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/267","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19212","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7e65fa522cff0172990568230ff9b719b8650296/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1030.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1030","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1030.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6fc85c731fb3018b2c4fbe9aed66186edd5321b/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1030.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/counter.nasl","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1030.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5707ac17-5923-4f38-badf-6ea549fb932d.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0885.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0885.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0885.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0686","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0686.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0765","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9143,\"outputTokens\":19,\"totalTokens\":10826}}","description":"SGI IRIX 6.5.4 中的 midikeys 程序存在本地权限提升漏洞，该程序以 root 权限运行且允许本地用户通过文本编辑器修改任意文件。本地攻击者可利用该缺陷修改系统关键配置文件（如 /etc/passwd 或 sudoers 文件），从而提升权限至 root。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 6.5.4 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0（严重），攻击条件为本地用户账户访问权限，利用方式为通过 midikeys 程序调用文本编辑器修改关键系统文件实现提权。SGI 已发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0765"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-05-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:00Z","remediation":"建议立即移除 midikeys 程序的 setuid root 权限：`chmod u-s /usr/sbin/midikeys`，或升级到 SGI IRIX 6.5.5 及以上版本。如无法升级，可通过删除 midikeys 可执行权限 `chmod 000 /usr/sbin/midikeys` 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/262","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19210","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e244b55bdff85b2483c0e6a7cecd12f8bee0df6e/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0765.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0765","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0765.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0ea6b1a1298433599abdd2a4c6b6ce9f09476665/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0765.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d9ad03f9df46533ce9229f9da6bbf66bd77a3f4f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-4wg8-h27h-453j/GHSA-4wg8-h27h-453j.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0765.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153400_153500.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c5545578-048e-4acc-97a2-487c23d98355.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--c5545578-048e-4acc-97a2-487c23d98355.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0686.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0686.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0686.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1981","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1981.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1510","title":"BisonWare BisonFTP Server 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"BisonWare BisonFTP Server 4.1 之前版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 FTP 服务发送超长的 USER、LIST 或 CWD 命令触发栈缓冲区溢出，导致服务拒绝服务，在特定条件下可进一步实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 BisonFTP Server 3.5 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。目前已存在公开的 Metasploit 利用模块，增大了被攻击风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1510"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-05-17T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:35Z","remediation":"立即升级 BisonWare FTP Server 至 4.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 USER、LIST、CWD 命令的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法升级，建议在防火墙上限制仅允许可信 IP 访问 FTP 服务（21/TCP），并禁用匿名用户登录权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=92697301706956&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3234","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/17810","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5dccbdd02e04ed15263189c9e9adec0bd125446a/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1510.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1510","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/25d022b09657fe844947d1b6e33693a31318f832/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1510.md","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/remote-exploits/24613.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6471e48aab3adc28479bf4c8fa1d38ad4787a75a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1510.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db7261396795ee10e4834f0fdf94aec36b0936ff/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cgrj-8f57-5v5x/GHSA-cgrj-8f57-5v5x.json","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/xerror/parsing/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt","https://github.com/openctibr/threatFeeds/blob/84aac85d4d16bc32f5d2978699ce788ee1a8c2af/ExploitableVulnerabilitiesFeed.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1510.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1981.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0985","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0985.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1156","title":"BisonWare FTP Server PORT命令拒绝服务漏洞","description":"BisonWare FTP Server 4.1 及更早版本存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标 FTP 服务的 PORT 命令发送包含非数字字符及大量回车符的畸形数据包，导致 FTP 服务进程崩溃或停止响应，造成拒绝服务。攻击无需身份认证，仅需网络可达即可触发，利用难度较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1156"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-05-17T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:50Z","remediation":"BisonWare FTP Server 已停止维护且厂商已倒闭，建议迁移至活跃维护的 FTP 服务器软件如 vsftpd 或 ProFTPD。迁移前作为临时缓解措施，可在网络边界防火墙或 IPS 设备上添加规则，过滤包含大量回车符的畸形 FTP PORT 命令，并限制允许连接 FTP 服务的源 IP 范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2254","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/30c3a896d257362f7419b0c772be2f3dd063ccaa/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1156.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1156","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1156.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d0a8c476da89b37a2bbb6193b7964b10d03aff75/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1156.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-phmx-3wr6-q2h6/GHSA-phmx-3wr6-q2h6.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_500_600.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-241.txt","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/35c40c2c96029682f9c3da862749763b6c97e1fb/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-11xx/CVE-1999-1156.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000639.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/be7ad03fdf3a412f0fd57a25f1732dc0ecfb1cb3/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0985.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0315","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0315.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0716","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9224,\"outputTokens\":20,\"totalTokens\":10908}}","description":"Windows NT 4.0 帮助文件实用程序（help file utility）在处理格式错误的帮助文件（.hlp/.chm）时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过诱骗用户打开特制的恶意帮助文件触发该漏洞，导致在目标系统上执行任意代码或造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 全系列版本（含 SP1 至 SP5），CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中等。攻击者通常将恶意帮助文件捆绑于邮件附件或下载链接中，诱导用户手动打开即可触发利用。Microsoft 已在后续安全更新中修复该漏洞，受影响用户应安装相应补丁并避免打开来源不明的帮助文件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0716"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-05-17T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:54Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 于 1999 年 5 月 17 日发布的安全公告 MS99-015 所附补丁（KB231605），或通过 Windows Update 自动更新以消除该漏洞。如补丁不适用于当前环境，应将系统升级至受支持的 Windows 版本（如 Windows Server 2012 R2 或更高版本）。作为临时缓解措施，将 %windir%\\Help 目录的写入权限限制为仅管理员，并禁止打开来源不明的 .hlp 帮助文件，同时部署应用控制策略阻止非授权帮助文件的执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ231605","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-015","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19209","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/cf29b986be3ae7c9144123b101d864868676099e/1999/CVE-1999-0716.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/64d76d92cfbd9c4de4a352a59a2e52cadebc3afd/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0716.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/89b3a1c34ab26afed5cfe4fc54b61cecbf09d3c2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0716.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0716","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/bc3b224aa865bb4a5c31d7720dca83e446e475e2/1999/CVE-1999-0716.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/178b809924783e13787d17bb1b1fd55ad3b8639b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0716.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0716.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/ec2efce98d544aa857266906f720ae32e42b21be/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-07xx/CVE-1999-0716.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f4098a65ae9e8440f9d959bbd974af1ed2176bec/1999/CVE-1999-0716.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0716.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0315.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0315.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0315.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0208","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0208.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0489","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.0 未信任脚本粘贴漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 5.0 的 MSHTML.DLL 组件存在不可信脚本粘贴漏洞，远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页，利用脚本将用户本地文件路径粘贴至文件上传内建控件中，从而在用户无感知的情况下强制上传任意本地文件。该漏洞属于 MS98-013 公告所述\"不可信脚本粘贴\"问题的变种，攻击者无需任何用户交互即可窃取敏感文件。影响 Internet Explorer 5.0 及可能更早版本，CVSS v2.0 评分为 10.0，危害严重。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0489"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-05-17T00:00:00Z","updated":"1999-05-17T00:00:00Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS98-013 提供的补丁，将 mshtml.dll 升级至 4.72.3509.0100 及以上版本。对于 Windows 98 用户，通过 Windows Update 获取关键更新。对于已停止支持的旧系统，建议升级至受支持的 Windows 版本并使用现代浏览器，同时在 IE 中禁用活动脚本和跨域访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0208.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0208.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1082","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1082.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1366","title":"Pegasus E-mail客户端弱加密存储密码漏洞","description":"Pegasus 电子邮件客户端 3.0 及更早版本在 pmail.ini 配置文件中使用弱加密算法存储 POP3 密码，本地攻击者可通过直接读取该配置文件并利用弱加密的逆向工程轻易解密出明文密码，进而获取用户邮箱的访问权限并读取邮件内容。该漏洞影响 Pegasus Mail 3.0 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 3.6，危害等级低，攻击前提是攻击者已获得本地系统访问权限。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1366"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-05-15T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:17Z","remediation":"升级到 Pegasus Mail 4.0 或更高版本，该版本已使用更强的加密算法存储 POP3 密码。同时确保 pmail.ini 文件仅允许受信任用户访问，可通过文件系统权限将该文件设为仅当前用户可读。如果无法升级，建议更换为支持安全密码存储的其他邮件客户端。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92714118829880&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/851a313c6bc1948d5487aca773aa21ade52b7c28/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1366.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1366","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1366.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/929f101fd7b4d4314a4b92f62a8cc2523c6d76f0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1366.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/491d1a908ffff7b174e17aaac4d0207c13405fa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h93v-m49q-355g/GHSA-h93v-m49q-355g.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1366.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000637.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/0bc422e082b7e01390f70e5565b0c87d6b52007c/1999.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--80679e4a-cea9-490e-88af-d157a83a5ea8.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1082.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0884","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0884.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1029","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9138,\"outputTokens\":20,\"totalTokens\":10822}}","description":"SSH 服务端 sshd2 在 2.0.12 之前版本存在认证日志缺陷。该服务在远程连接于达到最大登录尝试次数之前被关闭时，未能正确记录此次登录尝试。由于失败尝试未被写入审计日志，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过建立连接、尝试少量密码后主动断开并重连的方式，对目标账户进行密码暴力破解，同时规避入侵检测与审计追踪。该漏洞影响所有早于 2.0.12 的 sshd2 版本，攻击仅需网络可达目标 SSH 服务且无需合法凭据，利用门槛低，CVSS 评分为 7.5，危害等级为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1029"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-05-13T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:33Z","remediation":"升级 SSH2 服务端至 2.0.12 或更高版本以修复审计日志绕过问题。若暂无法升级，可在 sshd 配置中降低 PasswordAuthentication 最大尝试次数（MaxAuthTries）、启用公钥认证并禁用密码登录，同时部署 fail2ban 对失败登录进行封禁，并结合防火墙限制 SSH 端口来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92663402004280&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/277","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2193","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7e65fa522cff0172990568230ff9b719b8650296/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1029.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1029","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1029.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6fc85c731fb3018b2c4fbe9aed66186edd5321b/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1029.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5d945305f2cad48b7bb06af582393a58c31555d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6mfv-3x79-9r84/GHSA-6mfv-3x79-9r84.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153400_153500.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/277/info.html","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-223.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--7c795f8b-9ad3-4a47-b7c5-c836dcd4935e.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0884.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1084","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1084.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1368","title":"InoculateIT MS Exchange Server 防病毒选项邮件扫描绕过漏洞","description":"InoculateIT 4.53 的 MS Exchange Server 选项中的 AV 选项仅扫描 Microsoft Exchange 服务器的收件箱文件夹树，当用户邮件规则将邮件移动到其他邮箱时，病毒可绕过检测。该漏洞影响 InoculateIT 4.53 及可能其他版本，攻击者利用邮件规则转移恶意邮件即可逃避扫描，导致病毒检测失效。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，需升级至修复版本或调整扫描策略以覆盖所有邮箱文件夹。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1368"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-05-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:17Z","remediation":"升级 InoculateIT 反病毒软件至 4.53 以上版本，或启用针对所有 Exchange 邮箱文件夹（包括非收件箱子文件夹）的全面扫描策略。在 AV Option 配置中取消 \"仅扫描收件箱\" 的限制，确保规则移动后的邮件仍被扫描，避免病毒绕过检测。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=92652152723629&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=97439568517355&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/41de94138b7cf6e858138ec4e79e16fbec611fa4/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1368.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1368","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1368.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3012e5f1cf9bcfe839897275a956236aed334269/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1368.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa37ed0317ce1265b487f92916077b9ccbfe3349/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qgqh-3fh5-37xc/GHSA-qgqh-3fh5-37xc.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1368.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153400_153500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000635.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--9186387f-2fa8-40f8-814b-8ce0daf4dc95.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1084.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0017","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0017.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0229","title":"Microsoft Windows NT IIS 目录遍历拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 服务器存在路径遍历拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标服务器发送包含特殊构造的 `..\\..` 序列的 HTTP 请求触发目录遍历，导致服务器资源耗尽或崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 系统上的 Microsoft IIS 服务，利用方式简单，危害性较高。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0229"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-05-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:57Z","remediation":"升级至 Windows 2000 及以上版本（含 IIS 5.0+），或在 Windows NT 4.0 上安装 IIS 4.0 Service Pack 及 MS98-004 安全补丁。如无法升级，在 IIS 管理器中禁用未使用的虚拟目录并移除可执行权限以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0229","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dc83b9e6d88de194a14e3020b4e71ac42054e609/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0229.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0229","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0229.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0229.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/04a84e78299e2aeaab4d2594fc26f920778c7b06/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0229.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1b2e09705f0816776a0a8a0cd6fc1208d25f09b2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-79m3-vm8c-387r/GHSA-79m3-vm8c-387r.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/I/iis_crash.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2218/info.html","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/97009c469920f4d8991128f84d19644c3badca15/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-02xx/CVE-1999-0229.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0017.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0507","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0507.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0776","title":"Alibaba HTTP 服务器 目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Alibaba HTTP 服务器存在目录遍历（路径遍历）漏洞。该服务器未能正确过滤 HTTP 请求中的 ../（点点）路径序列，导致远程攻击者可在未认证的情况下，通过构造包含点号序列的特制 HTTP 请求读取 Web 根目录之外的任意文件。受影响范围为运行 Alibaba HTTP 服务器的系统，攻击条件仅需攻击者能与目标服务器建立普通 HTTP 连接。利用方式通常为在 GET 请求的路径中拼接 ../../../../etc/passwd 等序列，从而获取系统口令文件、配置文件或源代码等敏感信息，造成信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0776"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-05-12T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","remediation":"该 Alibaba HTTP 服务器已停止维护，建议立即停用并迁移至受支持的主流 Web 服务器（如 Apache HTTP Server、Nginx）。迁移前可在前端部署反向代理或 WAF，配置规则拦截请求路径中包含 ../ 或编码形式的目录遍历序列作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0776","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/main/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0776.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0507.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1157","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1157.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1520","title":"Microsoft Site Server Commerce Edition 3.0 AdSamples 敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft Site Server 3.0 Commerce Edition 的 AdSamples 示例目录存在配置缺陷，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过 HTTP 直接访问该目录下的 SITE.CSC 文件，该文件泄露了 SQL 数据库连接字符串等敏感信息。攻击者可利用泄露的凭据进一步渗透后端数据库，导致数据泄露。影响 Microsoft Site Server 3.0，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1520"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-05-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:36Z","remediation":"删除生产环境中的 AdSamples 示例目录及其所有子文件，或通过 IIS 管理器将该目录的匿名访问权限移除，仅允许管理员 IP 访问。同时确保 SITE.CSC 文件位于非 Web 可访问目录下，且数据库连接字符串使用加密存储而非明文配置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92647407227303&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/256","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2270","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19208","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4441343672f486c63736487674c197dfd2a4f256/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1520.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1520","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1520.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/33dc7d7c01654661dd82814415270cb51d2d0728/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1520.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9a3495eb833b3f1f2096187c4b14884afc98b67a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-35r7-w24m-px2g/GHSA-35r7-w24m-px2g.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1520.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153400_153500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000634.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--20a05048-fb43-437d-b413-9da3aec8f741.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1157.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1157.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1157.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0608","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0608.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0754","title":"INN inndstart 权限提升漏洞","description":"INN（InterNetNews）新闻服务器的 inndstart 程序存在权限提升漏洞。该程序在启动时会信任并读取由环境变量 INNCONF 所指定的配置文件路径，本地已登录的普通用户可通过在运行 inndstart 前自行设置 INNCONF 环境变量，将其指向攻击者可控的恶意配置文件，从而诱导以特权（如 news 用户或 root）身份运行的 inndstart 加载该配置并执行其中的危险指令或参数，最终实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响使用存在缺陷版本 INN 软件且允许本地用户执行 inndstart 的 Unix/Linux 系统，攻击前提是攻击者需具备目标系统的本地账户访问权限且系统未对 INNCONF 环境变量做安全过滤。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0754"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-05-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:59Z","remediation":"建议升级 INN (InterNetNews) 至 2.2.1 或更高版本，该版本修复了 inndstart 的 INNCONF 环境变量权限提升漏洞。若暂时无法升级，可通过在用户登录脚本或 /etc/profile 中取消设置 INNCONF 环境变量（unset INNCONF），并限制普通用户对 inndstart 的执行权限（chmod 750 /usr/local/news/bin/inndstart）作为临时缓解措施。建议参考 ISC 官方安全公告升级至 INN 2.6.0 或更新版本彻底修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.redhat.com/corp/support/errata/inn99_05_22.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/255","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/cf29b986be3ae7c9144123b101d864868676099e/1999/CVE-1999-0754.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e268305fd8644994d337819e469d1f89bafde833/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0754.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0754","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/76af88afbb282d6c9e8ce3b9f6942bcb7e39be57/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0754.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0754.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d9ad03f9df46533ce9229f9da6bbf66bd77a3f4f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-c5pf-965c-g6g8/GHSA-c5pf-965c-g6g8.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/255/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/134977c5f4ce4f427a914ca161b4f075e34b560b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0754.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153400_153500.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0608.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0514","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0514.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0785","title":"ISC INN inndstart 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"ISC INN (InterNetNews) 新闻服务器软件中的 inndstart 程序存在权限管理缺陷，由于未对 inn.conf 配置文件中的 \"pathrun\" 参数进行充分校验，本地攻击者可通过构造恶意的 pathrun 路径参数，使 inndstart 以 root 权限执行任意程序，从而实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 ISC INN 多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。建议升级至最新版本或严格限制 inn.conf 文件的写入权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0785"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-05-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:03Z","remediation":"升级 ISC INN 至 2.2.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 inndstart 对 pathrun 参数的不安全处理。如无法升级，确保 inn.conf 中 pathrun 指向受保护目录（如 /usr/local/news/bin），且该目录仅允许 root 用户写入，同时移除 inndstart 的 setuid root 权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/254"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0514.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0514.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0501","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0501.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0773","title":"Sun Solaris 7.0 lpset 本地缓冲区溢出提权漏洞","description":"Sun Solaris 7.0 系统中的 lpset 命令在处理命令行参数时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于程序未对用户输入的打印机名称等参数进行长度校验，本地攻击者可通过构造超长参数触发栈溢出，覆盖返回地址并执行任意代码，从而将普通用户权限提升至 root。该漏洞属于本地利用，攻击者可借助 setuid 位安装的 lpset 程序完成权限提升，影响运行 Solaris 7 且未打补丁的主机。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0773"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1999-05-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级到已修复该问题的 Solaris 补丁版本（建议安装 Sun 补丁簇 107115-xx 或更高版本，使用 patchadd 命令安装）。在无法立即打补丁前，可临时移除 /usr/bin/lpset 的 setuid 权限（执行 chmod u-s /usr/bin/lpset），并限制其仅由 lp 系统用户访问，以消除本地提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.netspace.org/cgi-bin/wa?A2=ind9905B&L=bugtraq&P=R2017","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19206","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/abfccbe3a11aa2b9dde2cfba5a12ba6256820a51/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0773.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0501.toml"}]